 The format is based on [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.1.0/)
 and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0.html).

+## [0.6.0-2022.12] - Local candidate
+
+- Await asynchronous C# snippets in `eval` and `eval_file`. The snippet's `cancellationToken` is signaled on timeout or job cancellation.
+- Compile without executing or loading the result with `dry_run`. Diagnostics point to the original snippet's lines and columns.
+
 ## [0.6.0-2022.11] - Local candidate

 - Validate build targets, scenes and requested Build Profiles before queuing. Dry runs report the resolved configuration.
